064300
064400*---------- IF THIS IS A BANBURY EXPLOSION PROGRAM (MAIN PGM
064500*---------- "TRMCORR"), THE WORKORDER FIELD IS USED FOR PRODUCTION
064600*---------- DATE ENTRY.  WE VALIDATE THE DATE ENTERED WITH
064700*---------- "TDATECHK", THEN PUT IT IN THE FORMAT THAT CUTOFF
064800*---------- EXPECTS IT IN (I.E. 10-18-84).
064900     IF BANBURY-CORR-FLAG = "Y"
065000         MOVE DE-WO                TO  DATE-VALIDATE-IN
065100         MOVE 3                    TO  DATE-MODE
065200         CALL "TDATECK2" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA, LANGUAGE-PARMS
065300         IF DATE-RET-CODE = 0
065400             MOVE DATE-YMD-OUT     TO  YMD-WORK
065500             MOVE YMD-YY           TO  PROD-DT-YY
065600             MOVE YMD-MM           TO  PROD-DT-MM
065700             MOVE YMD-DD           TO  PROD-DT-DD
065800             MOVE "-"              TO  PROD-SLASH-1
065900                                       PROD-SLASH-2
066000         ELSE
066100             MOVE DATE-MSG         TO  MESSAGE-BUFFER
066200             MOVE 8                TO  FIELD-NUMBER
066300             PERFORM 9999-SETERROR-1
066400             GO TO 63-SHOWFORM-2.
